<title>JAPAN: Nikko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nikko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.92		vs	   17.26</p>
<p> Operating	  791    million	  vs	  879    million</p>
<p> Current	    966    million	  vs	    1.10</p>
<p> Net		  485    million	  vs	  637    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.40 yen	  vs	   13.65 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     47 million	  vs	  47 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.35 yen	  vs	    4.35 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nikko Co Ltd is a manufacturer specialising in civil engineering.</p>
